$ npm run size-delta-prove

> size-delta-prove
> node scripts/size-delta-prove.mjs

ok   +300 B on index passes
ok   a second +300 B on top of it passes
ok   +600 B on index fails and names chunk, base, PR, allowance
ok   a new chunk is held to its ceiling only
ok   a removed chunk passes and is reported
ok   a chunk gone from the PR that still has a ceiling fails
ok   without a base only the ceilings run and the delta command is printed
ok   over the absolute ceiling fails even inside the allowance
size-delta-prove: all cases behave
